Subtask 3.8: Troubleshooting Common Issues

If you encounter issues, try these troubleshooting steps:

    Service fails to start:

# Check service status
sudo systemctl status httpd
# Check logs
sudo journalctl -u httpd -f

    Port already in use:

# Check what's using the port
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep :8080
# Kill the process if needed
sudo kill -9 <PID>

    Firewall issues:

# Check firewall status
sudo firewall-cmd --list-all
# Manually open port if needed
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=8080/tcp
sudo firewall-cmd --reload

    Permission issues:

# Check file permissions
ls -la /var/www/html/
# Fix permissions if needed
sudo chown -R apache:apache /var/www/html/

Advanced Role Features
Subtask 3.9: Create Role Dependencies

    Create a dependency role for common system setup:

cd ~/ansible-lab/roles
ansible-galaxy init common

    Edit the common role tasks:

vim common/tasks/main.yml

---
- name: Update system packages
  package:
    name: '*'
    state: latest
  become: yes
  when: update_system | default(false)

- name: Install common packages
  package:
    name:
      - vim
      - curl
      - wget
      - net-tools
    state: present
  become: yes

- name: Configure timezone
  timezone:
    name: "{{ system_timezone | default('UTC') }}"
  become: yes

    Update webserver role to depend on common:

vim webserver/meta/main.yml

Add to the dependencies section:

dependencies:
  - role: common
    vars:
      system_timezone: "America/New_York"

